      "rationale": "History mode of ADR 0011 (#16). It walks the first-parent history, reads each changed file's units syntactically, and follows them from commit to commit with matchIdentities, through renames and moves. It records a version whenever a unit's content changed, classed from its hashes and signature text, with rationale, actor and issue links from the commit and a computed confidence. A unit's prehistory ends at the commit that first recorded its unit file, and restarts where a match would only be queued. On this repository: 42 commits, 8 units with prehistory.",
